{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,260p' packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/06-message-turn-delete/005-implementor.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\"command\":\"story-implement\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"221f13f3-f9b7-4b67-ad55-866359348c37\",\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"model\":\"claude-fable-5\",\"role\":\"story_implementor\",\"sessionId\":\"0b78a89b-de9b-459e-9df3-9832eb021204\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"0b78a89b-de9b-459e-9df3-9832eb021204\",\"storyId\":\"06-message-turn-delete\"},\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"06-message-turn-delete\",\"title\":\"Story 6: Message and Turn Delete\"},\"planSummary\":\"Resumed after attempt 003's provider crash, which had left a complete in-tree implementation. Verified it against the story, tech design (Flows 5/6, §Mechanics, DD-8), and test plan: messages.deleteMessage and turns.deleteTurn stamp deleted_at on projection rows only (events untouched), share Story 5's cascade via a drop-vs-clear parameterized core (deleted subject's forms DELETE'd, upward forms cleared+re-queued at the next source version, queued items superseded), prompt protection refuses initiating-prompt deletes with message_initiates_turn naming the turn and both turns-delete paths, empty chunks drop their summary forms with no rebuild queued, and the deleted-read filter covers message reads, turn reads, membership, chunk member loads, and composition inputs (proven by captureInputs in TC-6.5). Completed the unfinished tail: rebuilt dist (parity tests had failed only on a stale build), recorded the two new test files in the red-manifest per project convention, and added the new process-suite file to vitest.config.ts's exclusion list so it runs under verify-all only. Both gates green.\",\"changedFiles\":[{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"deleteMessage operation (validation incl. prompt protection, deleted_at stamp, delete cascade) and applyTurnDeleteCascade cross-domain surface for turns.deleteTurn (DD-8 one cascade, two callers)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/cascade.ts\",\"reason\":\"drop-vs-clear parameterized core cascade; cascadeMessageDelete and cascadeTurnDelete entry points; empty-chunk drop path; supersede of queued items against dropped subjects\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/messages/internal/store.ts\",\"reason\":\"markMessageDeleted/markTurnMessagesDeleted tombstone writes (live-row scoped); initiatesTurn on the validation read; deleted-read filter on readMessages\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"deleteTurn operation: filtered validation, turn-row stamp, shared cascade via the messages domain's public surface\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/store.ts\",\"reason\":\"readMutableTurn filtered validation read; markTurnDeleted; deleted-read filters on readTurns turn rows and membership\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/cli/turns-mutate.ts\",\"reason\":\"NEW per tech design §Placement: lhc turns delete command\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/cli/messages-mutate.ts\",\"reason\":\"lhc messages delete command\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/src/cli/index.ts\",\"reason\":\"messages delete / turns delete dispatch, --message/--turn flag parsing, usage text\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/mutations-delete.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"NEW: TC-6.1 through TC-6.7 plus live-row-walk and background-mode production-path tests\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"NEW: TC-6.8 SDK/CLI parity twins plus CLI refusal parity (process suite)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\",\"reason\":\"recorded the two new Story 6 test files (hash-lock convention from prior stories)\"},{\"path\":\"packages/lhc/vitest.config.ts\",\"reason\":\"fix found in self-review: new process-suite file added to the LHC_PROCESS_SUITE exclusion list so it runs under verify-all only, matching every other cli-process file\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[\"test/mutations-delete.test.ts\",\"test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts\"],\"modified\":[],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":231,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":13},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm vitest run test/mutations-delete.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"LHC_PROCESS_SUITE=1 pnpm vitest run test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":0,\"findingsFixed\":[\"TC-6.8 parity tests failed against a stale dist/cli.js lacking the delete subcommands — environmental, not code; resolved by build (red-verify always rebuilds, so the gates were never at risk)\",\"test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts was absent from vitest.config.ts's process-suite exclusion list, so it ran inside plain verify/green-verify against the build artifact instead of under verify-all only — added to the list; green-verify now counts 204 (in-process only) and verify-all 231\",\"the two new test files were not yet recorded in test/red-manifest.json — recorded per the convention every prior story followed (immutability gate now pins 27 files)\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[\"handler source reads in messages/internal/forms.ts (message row/blocks loaded at derivation time) carry no deleted_at filter — deliberate: they are not in §Mechanics' site list, and a handler racing a delete is already harmless because the dropped form row makes its UPDATE-only completion discard as stale_discarded, with queued items superseded by the cascade; composition and chunk-summary input reads (the sites that matter) are filtered and proven by TC-6.2/TC-6.5 capture assertions\",\"cascade chainSubjects walk is deliberately unfiltered (commented in code): it runs after the delete stamps its subject, and the chain above a just-deleted record is exactly what must still cascade\"]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[\"TC-6.1–6.7 live in new test/mutations-delete.test.ts rather than the test plan's test/mutations.test.ts, and TC-6.8 in new test/cli-process-mutations-delete.test.ts rather than cli-process-work.test.ts — both target files are hash-locked in the red manifest by earlier stories; new-file-per-story is the approved Story 4/5 precedent (green may add files, not edit Red's)\",\"CLI flags spelled --message / --turn with --message-id / --turn-id accepted as aliases — extends Story 5's approved --message/--message-id alias deviation to the delete commands\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Hand to the story verifier: all TC-6.x and architecture-risk tests green, both gates pass at 204/231 (baseline 218 → 231, +13), DoD items checked (event read-back byte-stable in every delete variant, no unfiltered read path on the §Mechanics site list, CLI parity).\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/06-message-turn-delete/005-implementor.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-06-11T07:47:12.982Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-06-11T07:53:15.257Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
